Package: UmarDataBotR
Type: Package
Title: Run Logging and Notifications for UMAR Automation Scripts
Version: 0.1.0
Author: Maja Zalo\u017enik
Maintainer: Maja Zaloznik <maja.zaloznik@gmail.com>
Description: One mechanism for timestamped logging, error-tolerant steps and
    email routing in UMAR's scheduled runners. Failures go to the maintainer,
    data-update notices go to users, and weekly or monthly jobs send a
    heartbeat so that a run that never happened is noticed.
License: GPL (>= 3)
Encoding: UTF-8
Depends: R (>= 4.1.0)
Imports:
    gmailr (>= 2.0.0)
Suggests:
    testthat (>= 3.0.0)
Config/testthat/edition: 3
Roxygen: list(markdown = TRUE)
Config/roxygen2/version: 8.1.0
